WEBVTT

00:02:24.640 --> 00:02:30.521
and so it is our calling
to protect it from harm

00:02:30.521 --> 00:02:32.148
for our children

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:34.734
who are yet to arrive from the future.

00:02:35.526 --> 00:02:40.281
I went home to be with my people
to protect our livelihood

00:02:40.323 --> 00:02:41.741
and our heritage.

00:02:41.741 --> 00:02:43.951
But here's where the plot twists.

00:02:44.577 --> 00:02:45.786
When I returned home,

00:02:45.828 --> 00:02:48.873
the first thing I did was
I wanted to build myself a house.

00:02:48.915 --> 00:02:52.084
People in the villages understood
that I was away from home

00:02:52.126 --> 00:02:53.419
for a long time,

00:02:53.419 --> 00:02:59.008
so they advised me to build a house
that was made of traditional materials,

00:02:59.008 --> 00:03:01.385
using traditional knowledge and skills.